00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.900
So, yeah boom, I'm gonna do some poetry.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.900
- [Michael] You serious?
- [Ashley] Okay

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:56.204
