00:00:56.204 --> 00:00:59.030
Like, it's about, you know
what I mean, like heartbreak.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:02.230
Okay, all right. (nervously breathes out)

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.063
Okay.

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:05.775
Okay.

00:01:05.775 --> 00:01:06.608
